stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: caller check
    q_check_auth --> q_check_refund: caller is legionOperator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_refund --> q_publish: hasEnded AND refundPeriodExpired
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_timing: preconditions not met
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert PreconditionsNotMet
    q_publish --> [*]: set totalRaisedCapital, emit RaisedCapitalPublished

    note right of q_publish
        INV-001: raised capital reflects project-accepted amount post refunds
        INV-002: only callable after refund period expiration
    end note
